Clease witnessed [[Simon Judeau]] shouting at [[Eathon Lambert]] to be his dog. He gave Eathon his word that he would never tell a soul. {{source|The Secret of Two Generations}}

Clease decided to tell [[Lok]] of this since he was his son and wanted to help him find out more. However, on the way home Clease was ambushed by [[The Professor]] and his two [[Suits]]. Clease was temporarily put under the control by [[Araknos]]'s 'Mastermind' power. He was used to enter [[Dante's house]] and disable the magical protective barrier around it. {{source|The Secret of Two Generations}}

Clease was present when [[Klaus]] was turned back from stone by [[King Basilisk]]. {{source| The Blood Spiral}}

Clease was trying to train and monitor a bored [[Den]] and got buried under a pile of books after an accident in the library.{{Source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}
